      en: ["The thermal hospital was founded by Queen Leonor in 1485.", "The Bordallo Pinheiro ceramics factory was established in 1884.", "Dom Carlos I Park was redesigned in the 19th century in Romantic style.", "Caldas da Rainha was elevated to city status (Cidade) in 1927.", "The José Malhoa Museum opened in 1933 as the first regional art museum.", "The Church of Nossa Senhora do Pópulo was completed in 1500 in Manueline style."],
